page.includeJSFooterlibs.solr-jquery >

# --- skillflow: skills search pages and detail page ---
# Skillflow (set webconsulting/skillflow-solr) configures its skills search on
# the pages of the site settings skillflow.search.pages (theme look) and
# skillflow.search.typo3Pages (typo3.org look), and links results to
# skillflow.detailPage. The values live in config/sites/<site>/settings.yaml:
# desiderio-corporate-starter lists 1063 (typo3.org look), desiderio lists
# 1030 "Find a skill" and the detail page 1066 below /ai/agentic-skills.
# The page-scoped TypoScript that used to sit here (skills-only query,
# Bootstrap and FontAwesome from a CDN, the EXTBASEPLUGIN override on 1066,
# the global result URL) is no longer needed.
